1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,619
Surat itu,

2
00:00:00,870 --> 00:00:01,992
akan kuambil sendiri.

3
00:00:05,572 --> 00:00:05,977
Dapat.

4
00:00:06,772 --> 00:00:08,047
Am-ampun…

5
00:00:08,448 --> 00:00:09,000
Penjara prefektur,

6
00:00:09,817 --> 00:00:10,903
sekarang kau yang masuk.

7
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:13,411
Rantai ini,

8
00:00:13,832 --> 00:00:14,656
kukembalikan.

9
00:00:14,709 --> 00:00:16,383
Orang yang kalian usik,

10
00:00:16,444 --> 00:00:19,045
bukan lawan kalian.

11
00:00:19,117 --> 00:00:20,987
Suratnya sudah kuberikan,

12
00:00:21,805 --> 00:00:22,774
ampuni nyawaku.

13
00:00:24,381 --> 00:00:25,198
Barang ayahku

14
00:00:26,005 --> 00:00:27,100
memang milikku.

15
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:30,407
Katanya,

16
00:00:30,627 --> 00:00:31,982
dia tahu siapa kamu.

17
00:00:32,044 --> 00:00:32,756
Tidak tanya?

18
00:00:33,244 --> 00:00:33,672
Kalau kamu mau cerita,

19
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:35,659
baru aku dengar.

20
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:36,928
Punyamu.

21
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:37,829
Aku…

22
00:00:38,066 --> 00:00:39,344
tak berani membukanya.

23
00:00:39,522 --> 00:00:40,410
Aku temani kau membukanya.

24
00:00:42,722 --> 00:00:43,869
Ayah…

25
00:00:45,922 --> 00:00:46,565
Kertas kosong?

26
00:00:47,122 --> 00:00:48,265
Mana ada surat,

27
00:00:49,077 --> 00:00:50,283
aku menipumu.

28
00:00:53,812 --> 00:00:55,552
Kukira…

29
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,603
kukira aku sudah menemukannya…

30
00:00:58,134 --> 00:00:59,523
Aku di sini.

31
00:01:03,734 --> 00:01:04,276
Rombongan itu,

32
00:01:04,605 --> 00:01:05,912
besok pagi dibawa ke prefektur.

33
00:01:05,978 --> 00:01:07,246
Hari ayahku dihukum,

34
00:01:07,636 --> 00:01:09,403
tuduhannya bersekongkol dengan musuh.

35
00:01:09,977 --> 00:01:12,182
Ia menjaga perbatasan utara dua puluh tahun.

36
00:01:12,386 --> 00:01:13,765
Giok ini,

37
00:01:13,835 --> 00:01:14,750
tak pernah lepas darinya.

38
00:01:15,535 --> 00:01:17,816
Ia titipkan pada pengawal paling tepercaya,

39
00:01:18,053 --> 00:01:18,956
untuk dibawa pergi.

40
00:01:19,457 --> 00:01:19,815
Orang itu,

41
00:01:20,246 --> 00:01:21,743
tak pernah kembali.

42
00:01:22,077 --> 00:01:23,087
Terakhir,

43
00:01:23,616 --> 00:01:24,467
dia pergi ke mana?

44
00:01:24,815 --> 00:01:26,368
Surat terakhirnya bilang,

45
00:01:27,222 --> 00:01:29,055
sudah sampai di Liuxi, Qingzhou.

46
00:01:29,134 --> 00:01:29,805
Jadi giok ini

47
00:01:30,493 --> 00:01:31,771
hilang di Liuxi.

48
00:01:33,950 --> 00:01:35,295
Ibu tak kunjung dapat kabar,

49
00:01:35,367 --> 00:01:37,058
jatuh sakit dan tak bangun lagi.

50
00:01:37,126 --> 00:01:39,144
Makam di hutan bambu itu,

51
00:01:39,933 --> 00:01:40,969
itu ibuku.

52
00:01:43,305 --> 00:01:44,473
Fitnah atas ayahmu,

53
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,429
akan kubersihkan bersamamu.

54
00:01:45,963 --> 00:01:46,823
Malam di penginapan itu,

55
00:01:47,055 --> 00:01:48,174
terima kasih sudah menahanku.

56
00:01:48,708 --> 00:01:51,713
Poin suka Qin Shuang, enam puluh enam.

57
00:01:56,315 --> 00:01:57,428
Xu Yan.

58
00:01:57,515 --> 00:01:59,216
Kau sering tersenyum ke arah sana.

59
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,402
Ada apa di sana?
